# API keys live in the OS credential vault (Windows Credential Manager) via
# `services/credential_store.py`, not in the database. Pulls in
# pywin32-ctypes on Windows, which the Windows backend calls into — both need
# a `hiddenimports` entry in packaging/TrophyTracker.spec, because keyring resolves its
# backend through entry points and PyInstaller cannot see that statically.
